        "id": "major-question-01",
        "label": "第1問",
        "order": 1,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-01\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-01\"><h2>第1問 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-key-panel\"><h3>解答</h3><dl class=\"batch-answer-key\"><div><dt>(1)</dt><dd>ア <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"8\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(1)</dt><dd>イ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\pi-3\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(1)</dt><dd>ウ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"k+1-\\sqrt{k^2+k+1}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(1)</dt><dd>エ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac{2025}{4}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(2)</dt><dd>オ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac34x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(2)</dt><dd>カ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac{x-3}{9}\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{AB}}+\\frac{12-x}{3x}\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{AC}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(2)</dt><dd>キ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"4\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(2)</dt><dd>ク <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac{4\\sqrt3}{3}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(3)</dt><dd>ケ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac{3}{32}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(3)</dt><dd>コ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac25\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(3)</dt><dd>サ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac14p_n+\\frac14\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(3)</dt><dd>シ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\frac13\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div></dl></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(1)　最も近い整数を区間ごとに決める</h3><p class=\"prose\">定義を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x-1/2&lt;N(x)\\leqq x+1/2\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> と読み換え、その区間に入る整数を探します。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c1f317159ff9\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">最も近い整数を区間ごとに決める</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"7&lt;3\\sqrt7-\\frac12&lt;N(3\\sqrt7)&lt;3\\sqrt7+\\frac12&lt;8.5\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c1f317159ff9\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">最も近い整数を区間ごとに決める</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"N(3\\sqrt7)=8\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c1f317159ff9\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">最も近い整数を区間ごとに決める</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"N(\\pi)=3,\\qquad f(\\pi)=|\\pi-3|=\\pi-3\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"k+1/2&lt;\\sqrt{k^2+k+1}&lt;k+1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> を示すと、最も近い整数が <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"k+1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> と決まります。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c1f317159ff9\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">最も近い整数を区間ごとに決める</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"N(\\sqrt{k^2+k+1})=k+1\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c1f317159ff9\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">最も近い整数を区間ごとに決める</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"f(\\sqrt{k^2+k+1})=k+1-\\sqrt{k^2+k+1}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">積分では各整数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"m\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> から <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"m+1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> までを、中央の <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"m+1/2\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> で2つに分けます。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c1f317159ff9\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">最も近い整数を区間ごとに決める</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"f(x)=\\begin{cases}x-m&amp;(m\\leqq x&lt;m+\\frac12)\\\\m+1-x&amp;(m+\\frac12\\leqq x&lt;m+1)\\end{cases}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c1f317159ff9\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">最も近い整数を区間ごとに決める</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\int_m^{m+1}f(x)dx=\\frac14\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c1f317159ff9\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">最も近い整数を区間ごとに決める</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\int_0^{2025}f(x)dx=\\sum_{m=0}^{2024}\\frac14=\\frac{2025}{4}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(2)　垂直条件を内積で2本立てる</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-285ae819463a\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">垂直条件を内積で2本立てる</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"|\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{AP}}|=\\frac{x}{2},\\qquad |\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{AQ}}|=3\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-285ae819463a\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">垂直条件を内積で2本立てる</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{AP}}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{AQ}}=\\frac{x}{2}\\cdot3\\cdot\\frac12=\\frac34x\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{AR}}=s\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{AB}}+t\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{AC}}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> と置きます。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\mathrm{AB}\\perp\\mathrm{CR}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\mathrm{AC}\\perp\\mathrm{BR}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> を内積0に直します。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-285ae819463a\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">垂直条件を内積で2本立てる</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"12s+x(t-1)=0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-285ae819463a\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">垂直条件を内積で2本立てる</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"3(s-1)+tx=0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-285ae819463a\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">垂直条件を内積で2本立てる</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"s=\\frac{x-3}{9},\\qquad t=\\frac{12-x}{3x}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-285ae819463a\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">垂直条件を内積で2本立てる</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{AR}}=\\frac{x-3}{9}\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{AB}}+\\frac{12-x}{3x}\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{AC}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\mathrm{BS}:\\mathrm{SC}=6:1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> からSの位置ベクトルの係数比は1:6です。Rも直線AS上にあるので、ARの2係数の比を合わせます。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-285ae819463a\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">垂直条件を内積で2本立てる</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{x-3}{9}:\\frac{12-x}{3x}=1:6\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-285ae819463a\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">垂直条件を内積で2本立てる</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"2x^2-5x-12=0\\Longrightarrow x=4\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\mathrm{AS}:\\mathrm{AR}=9:7\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> より、三角形BCRは三角形ABCの <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"2/9\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 倍です。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-285ae819463a\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">垂直条件を内積で2本立てる</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"[\\triangle BCR]=\\left(\\frac12\\cdot6\\cdot4\\sin\\frac\\pi3\\right)\\frac29=\\frac{4\\sqrt3}{3}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>別解</strong><p>原本はメネラウスとチェバを使う別解も示しています。垂足の比からx=4、続いてSR:RA=2:7を得る流れです。</p></aside><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-285ae819463a\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">垂直条件を内積で2本立てる</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{\\mathrm{AP}}{\\mathrm{PB}}\\cdot\\frac{\\mathrm{BS}}{\\mathrm{SC}}\\cdot\\frac{\\mathrm{CQ}}{\\mathrm{QA}}=1\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-285ae819463a\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">垂直条件を内積で2本立てる</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{\\mathrm{SR}}{\\mathrm{RA}}=\\frac27\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(3)　箱の遷移を表にする</h3><p class=\"prose\">3回の和が8になる並びを、2回目に3を引く場合と1回目に3を引く場合に分けます。</p><p class=\"prose\">どちらの箱もカードは4枚です。数字ではなくカードを区別すれば、3回の経路は64通りで等確率です。箱Bの「3」は2枚あるため、数字の並びが同じでも経路は2通りになる場合があります。</p><div class=\"table-scroll answer-table-scroll\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"和が8になる5種類の並び\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"source-table answer-table\"><caption>和が8になる5種類の並び</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">1回目</th><th scope=\"col\">2回目</th><th scope=\"col\">3回目</th><th scope=\"col\">カードの経路数</th><th scope=\"col\">確率</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></th><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"3\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"5\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\dfrac{1}{64}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></th><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"3\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"4\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\dfrac{1}{64}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"2\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></th><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"3\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"3\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></td><td>2</td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\dfrac{2}{64}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"3\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></th><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"4\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\dfrac{1}{64}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"3\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></th><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"5\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\dfrac{1}{64}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"prose\">該当する経路は1＋1＋2＋1＋1＝6通りです。表の確率を合計すると、次の値になります。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-5576a701ab3d\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">箱の遷移を表にする</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"P(\\text{和}=8)=\\frac{3}{32}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">2回目に3を引く道筋は、1回目が3か、3以外かの2通りです。条件付き確率は該当道筋を全該当道筋で割ります。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-5576a701ab3d\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">箱の遷移を表にする</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{\\frac14\\cdot\\frac12}{\\frac14\\cdot\\frac12+\\frac34\\cdot\\frac14}=\\frac25\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-5576a701ab3d\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">箱の遷移を表にする</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"p_{n+1}=p_n\\cdot\\frac12+(1-p_n)\\cdot\\frac14=\\frac14p_n+\\frac14\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-5576a701ab3d\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">箱の遷移を表にする</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"p_{n+1}-\\frac13=\\frac14\\left(p_n-\\frac13\\right)\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-5576a701ab3d\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">箱の遷移を表にする</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"p_n=-\\frac13\\left(\\frac14\\right)^n+\\frac13\\Longrightarrow\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}p_n=\\frac13\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-02",
        "label": "第2問",
        "order": 2,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-02\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-02\"><h2>第2問 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(1)　微分して増減表を作る</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-5bed3626772a\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">微分して増減表を作る</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"f&#39;(x)=2+\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-5bed3626772a\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">微分して増減表を作る</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"f&#39;(x)=0\\Longrightarrow x=-\\frac2{\\sqrt5}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">導関数の符号と、端点・停留点での関数値をまとめます。両端では導関数の値を置かず、斜線で示します。</p><div class=\"table-scroll answer-table-scroll answer-table-scroll--variation\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"増減表\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"source-table answer-table answer-table--variation\"><caption>増減表</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"-1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></th><th scope=\"col\">…</th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"-\\frac2{\\sqrt5}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></th><th scope=\"col\">…</th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"f&#39;(x)\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></th><td class=\"answer-table__no-value\" aria-label=\"値なし\"><svg class=\"answer-table__diagonal\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"100\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/></svg></td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"-\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"+\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></td><td class=\"answer-table__no-value\" aria-label=\"値なし\"><svg class=\"answer-table__diagonal\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"100\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/></svg></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"f(x)\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></th><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"-2\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></td><td>↘</td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"-\\sqrt5\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></td><td>↗</td><td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"2\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"prose\">端点と停留点を比較し、最小値は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"-\\sqrt5\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、最大値は2です。</p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(2)　直線から曲線を引く</h3><figure class=\"past-exam-figure\" data-figure-id=\"ans-q2-function-graph\"><img src=\"/assets/past-exams/kitasato-2025-general-mathematics/figures/ans-q2-function-graph.svg\" alt=\"関数y=2x−√(1−x²)の定義域は−1から1。最小点は(−2/√5,−√5)、端点は(−1,−2)と(1,2)。直線y=x+1とy軸、曲線で囲まれる領域Sを青く示す。\" width=\"740\" height=\"620\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"sync\"/><figcaption>関数の概形と、問(2)の面積S。</figcaption></figure><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c6f805a1511a\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">直線から曲線を引く</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"S=\\int_0^1\\left(1-x+\\sqrt{1-x^2}\\right)dx\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\sqrt{1-x^2}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> の積分は単位円の4分の1、または <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x=\\sin\\theta\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> の置換で計算します。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c6f805a1511a\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">直線から曲線を引く</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"S=\\frac12+\\frac\\pi4\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(3)　x軸回転は円板法</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-6530787ebb75\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">x軸回転は円板法</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"f(x)=0\\Longrightarrow x=\\frac1{\\sqrt5}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-6530787ebb75\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">x軸回転は円板法</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"V_x=\\pi\\int_0^{1/\\sqrt5}\\left(2x-\\sqrt{1-x^2}\\right)^2dx\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">平方を展開し、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\\sqrt{1-x^2}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"t=1-x^2\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> と置換します。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-6530787ebb75\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">x軸回転は円板法</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"V_x=\\frac{2\\sqrt5-4}{3}\\pi\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(4)　y軸回転はxをyで表す</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-35d273a11a92\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">y軸回転はxをyで表す</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"y=2x-\\sqrt{1-x^2}\\Longrightarrow x=\\frac{2y+\\sqrt{5-y^2}}5\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">外側の円板法の体積から、y軸と直線y=x+1が作る円錐の体積を引きます。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-35d273a11a92\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">y軸回転はxをyで表す</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"V_y=\\pi\\int_{-1}^{2}\\left(\\frac{2y+\\sqrt{5-y^2}}5\\right)^2dy-\\frac\\pi3\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-35d273a11a92\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">y軸回転はxをyで表す</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"V_y=\\pi\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">原本解説は、(1)の増減表を(2)の概形へつなぎ、(3)は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\pi\\int f(x)^2dx\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、(4)は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\pi\\int x^2dy\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> と立式する順序を示しています。上の解説もこの順序を保っています。</p></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-03",
        "label": "第3問",
        "order": 3,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-03\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-03\"><h2>第3問 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(1)　距離条件をそのまま二乗する</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c20f9aed3562\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">距離条件をそのまま二乗する</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"2\\sqrt{(x-1)^2+y^2}=|4-x|\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-c20f9aed3562\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">距離条件をそのまま二乗する</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"3x^2+4y^2=12\\Longrightarrow\\frac{x^2}{4}+\\frac{y^2}{3}=1\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(2)　接する条件は判別式0</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-bfac4eee7989\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">接する条件は判別式0</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"(4m^2+3)x^2+8mnx+(4n^2-12)=0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-bfac4eee7989\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">接する条件は判別式0</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"D=0\\Longrightarrow n=\\sqrt{4m^2+3}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-bfac4eee7989\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">接する条件は判別式0</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"d=\\frac{\\sqrt{4m^2+3}}{\\sqrt{m^2+1}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(3)　直交する2接線までの距離を合成する</h3><p class=\"prose\">傾きmの接線と直交する接線の傾きは <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"-1/m\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> です。原点から2本の接線までの距離を長方形の半辺として合成します。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-256785d927e9\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">直交する2接線までの距離を合成する</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"d&#39;=\\frac{\\sqrt{3m^2+4}}{\\sqrt{m^2+1}}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-256785d927e9\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">直交する2接線までの距離を合成する</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\mathrm{OP}=\\sqrt{d^2+d&#39;^2}=\\sqrt7\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">m=0の軸平行の場合も <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\mathrm{OP}=\\sqrt{(\\sqrt3)^2+2^2}=\\sqrt7\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> です。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-256785d927e9\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">直交する2接線までの距離を合成する</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\pi\\,\\mathrm{OP}^2=7\\pi\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>原本解説の要点を確認する</h3><p class=\"prose\">原本は、距離比から楕円を導き、連立2次方程式の重解条件で接線を決め、最後に直交する2接線までの距離から頂点Pの半径を求めています。</p><p class=\"prose\">長方形の辺と内部を原点の周りに回すと、半径OPの円全体を通過します。OPが向きによらず <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\sqrt7\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> で一定であることが、面積 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"7\\pi\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> を得る中心です。</p></section></div></article>"
      }
    ]
  },
